# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Moderation and admin user/contact administration.
# WHEN:  After role/policy changes, moderation workflow changes, or when
#        processing real reports/suggestions (Swagger/this file IS the
#        admin UI of the MVP).
# WHY:   Moderators may remove reviews (reason required, soft delete);
#        restore and role management are Admin-only - verify both policies.
# WHERE: Local with dev-login (moderator/admin); staging/production only as
#        a real staff member via Google session.
# AUTH:  Session cookie. Log in via 10-auth.http first:
#        - moderator requests: dev-login as {{devModeratorEmail}} (an Admin
#          must first assign the Moderator role via "Set user role" below)
#        - admin requests: dev-login as {{devAdminEmail}} (bootstrap admin)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Moderation queue - reviews under review (default)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/moderation/reviews

### Moderation queue - other statuses: Published | SoftDeleted | UnderReview | RemovedLegal
GET {{host}}/api/v1/moderation/reviews?status=Published&page=1&pageSize=20

### Remove a review as Moderator (reason is mandatory, soft delete)
# reviewId is captured by 30-reviews.http or taken from the queue above.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/moderation/reviews/{{reviewId}}/remove
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Verstoss gegen die Nutzungsbedingungen: beleidigender Inhalt."
}

### Remove - missing reason variant
# EXPECT: 400 ProblemDetails.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/moderation/reviews/{{reviewId}}/remove
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": ""
}

### Restore a removed review (Admin only)
# EXPECT: 403 when logged in as Moderator - verifies the policy boundary.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/moderation/reviews/{{reviewId}}/restore
X-CSRF: 1

### Moderation as anonymous variant
# EXPECT: 401. Run 10-auth "Logout" first.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/moderation/reviews

### List users (Admin) - paged
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users?page=1&pageSize=20

### Set user role (Admin): User | Moderator | Admin
# Copy the target userId from the list above.
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users/REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID/role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "Moderator"
}

### Set user role - invalid role variant
# EXPECT: 400 ProblemDetails.
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users/REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID/role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "Superuser"
}

### Contact-request queue (Admin): status New | InProgress | Resolved
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/contact-requests?status=New&page=1&pageSize=20

### Update contact-request status (Admin workflow: New -> InProgress -> Resolved)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/admin/contact-requests/REPLACE_WITH_REQUEST_ID/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InProgress"
}
